WQqIdJ_j6GsQ7kNvwH45WN_&_nc_oc=AdpXqztPUBzpH4Ahf0R5QatluhMSgAS8En8JZktPzfbKo2Wft5O3FqSMw5Aiblt6sw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af73JylUeF8mqB9QBWwMkvDcJcBTlqmsSJSKflXso6sRow&oe=6A0335B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pbBFXMxWXg0Q7kNvwEpJhjk&_nc_oc=AdpPsMVTANCogrO6o17d3YEACFjSuVWkI5ery-U-nwHt7oB55d8QuTALJb37YiPLu8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5jMSZgoJKtcyc2mhjN-a7fzSGNAmahT8TYXUgaOUUcAw&oe=6A03374A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jfiF6ldz72oQ7kNvwH77dHM&_nc_oc=AdrKLz89awXnTSlxfguY_3ZWDMNZQCjzBRIF6I51S1K89MrYTsgy3dKOYDmIO6tq5Do&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4AFRDM_mV1czbkNjlhr4iEonlds_vFYYoiNZlHEglO5g&oe=6A03246F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LkuAd6hV7SsQ7kNvwH8udK7&_nc_oc=AdpqaAus2x38ln_XzbrVmESHd0USXXlh5fsAymbQTSqzQcDIpM8rJsTBen8HGnCMtXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4tBHPMCg8pJsimUKIkmQDhDD5lPE_9Xe5iuyXjTb6QFg&oe=6A034603"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8NY99nDK7xYQ7kNvwEfNGBJ&_nc_oc=AdryYqf1VLYk3MI3PfxEt9bUjgZkkc-hLxPU4JxytANHFYraqIoQzgCwqJZpfO3tu0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5sFmeLmCJ9WoMniAfcXhr1Vv8_T_ql_Ze9odIg3urFYQ&oe=6A033E58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fV2eyxbo7hYQ7kNvwHsqkbf&_nc_oc=AdqTI5DrlJ5AeyvBS8MEir0PR_28-X3mysGI6IpjA4GzjtfLLbw8DIVLeCDXDyJmDqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7LhdjfU8_ct77Q7_wQueFt888HFU-aH42HyaW6pg45cA&oe=6A03193C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080